{"actor_id": "0a345b23dd614b989305c183298c4b8b", "attempt_id": "701188247f854d27b9ddfc6c80e13229", "based_on_seq": 1, "content": "**Proposal: Append-only log roundtrip test**\n\n1. Start with an empty log (seq 0).\n2. Append entry A at seq 1, entry B at seq 2.\n3. Read back the full range (after_seq=0, through_seq=2).\n4. Assert: entries return in order, contents unchanged, no gaps, no mutations of prior entries.\n5. Append entry C at seq 3; re-read and assert A and B are byte-identical.\n\nThis verifies ordering, immutability, and read-after-write consistency.\n\nTOKEN_A=roundtrip-682914", "event_seq": 5, "execution_receipt": {"attempt_id": "701188247f854d27b9ddfc6c80e13229", "based_on_seq": 1, "duration": 4.785911798477173, "error_hint": null, "error_kind": null, "error_type": null, "iteration_session_id": "fdb08beec5ac4ab7a2bf44f4e90ec290", "kind": "receipt", "model": "z-ai/glm-5.3", "outcome": "SUCCESS", "participant_id": "0a345b23dd614b989305c183298c4b8b", "produced_seq": 2, "provider": "nvidia", "read_from_seq": 1, "read_through_seq": 1, "round_id": "e00e13f17fdb4ac7b3967f3b6e925231", "turn_id": "6d7ad9106bc42a74688b9d58439ef5aa"}, "kind": "agent", "previous": "f30d94526ef270719a26887e21286c8587a32950d5d7e542742e92cd0589cd89", "seq": 2, "sha256": "799c1696a5abb0791c86052691bbbdf1c49b3066daea618ab30132166410b13d", "turn_id": "6d7ad9106bc42a74688b9d58439ef5aa"}
